# Marvel Multiverse Roadmap - Cursor Rules

# Project Architecture
- Zero-dependency Vanilla HTML5, CSS3, and modern ES6+ JavaScript.
- No React, Next.js, Vue, or Tailwind frameworks.
- Static pre-rendering powered by `scripts/prerender.js`.

# Non-Negotiable Rules
1. Zero Prohibited Dashes: Never use unicode em-dashes (U+2014) or en-dashes (U+2013). Always use standard ASCII hyphens (-) or commas (, ).
2. Dataset Sync: Keep `data/data.json` and `data/data.js` 100% identical. After any edit, run `npm test`.
3. Clean URLs: Use clean paths (`/`, `/support`, `/supporters`) without `.html` in internal hrefs.
4. Contributor Protocol: Maintainer Vaibhav Soni is Project Owner. External contributors appear on `pages/supporters.html` with dynamic GitHub avatars (`https://github.com/<username>.png?size=96`).
5. Quality Checks: Always ensure `npm run lint` and `npm test` pass before committing.
